  "details": "On world instance page, the flow for users who are not already logged in to the site is confusing and difficult.\nThe \"Invite Me\" button should appear regardless of whether the user is logged in. Then if the user is not logged in, the Invite Me button should prompt login and carry out its function automatically after login is completed.\n\nFor users who don't have a VRChat account yet, this is an opportunity to encourage them to register.",
